+
+   Exit `0`: `184 passed in 0.29s`.
+
+4. Strict type check:
+
+   `../venv/bin/python -m mypy`
+
+   Exit `0`: `Success: no issues found in 61 source files`.
+
+5. Full accepted-root pytest:
